== Description ==

'''Chrome Alloy''' is a refined metal ingot in ''[[Human Host]]'', crafted at the [[Cutting Workbench]]. It appears as an ingredient in 18 downstream recipes at the [[Cutting Workbench]], including [[Tungsten steel alloy]], among others. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

